      <activity id="6bd03823-b058-5465-80e7-10c681c020f3" activityNameId="8ab248a9-0644-5948-8f19-11c5463a2ea8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wheat seed organic, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wheat seed organic, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of wheat seed (fresh weight), with a maximum water content of 15%;
UUID: 699cfb58-3ac5-357f-8619-dd5ed72d49a1
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Consumption of wheat seed in Switzerland 17955 t/year, 0% imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_699cfb58-3ac5-357f-8619-dd5ed72d49a1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
